 "summary": "The HWRQ Platinum stages up to 32 boiler stages on outdoor reset or a fixed setpoint. Its BACnet board exposes the settings, per-boiler mode, status, lockout and communication-error objects, and the sensor readings, all as Analog, Binary and Multi-state Values with instances in steps of 100.",
